evidence = "RawNativeReceiptAuthorityV1 and its epoch accessor are absent from ffi_call.rs. Decision 1305 replaces the 247-byte V1 authority with height-keyed RawNativeReceiptAuthorityV2 at line 4610, which has no epoch, sequence, authorization-batch or sequencer fields. Repository-wide whole-word search of tracked files excludes spec and docs directories; remaining lists one first occurrence per file, including unrelated uses of the same identifier."
